sequenceDiagram
  participant U as User
  participant P as PdfSearchEngine
  participant X as PDF extract
  participant F as FAISS
  U->>P: from_pdfs(paths)
  P->>X: extract pages
  X-->>P: text pages
  P->>P: chunk with page meta
  P->>F: add vectors + ids
  U->>P: search(query)
  P->>F: ANN search
  F-->>P: ids + scores
  P-->>U: hits with source and page
